cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use gorti in research, please cite the software using this metadata."
type: software
title: "gorti: An open-source IEEE 1516-2010 Run-Time Infrastructure in Go"
abstract: >-
  gorti is an open-source IEEE 1516-2010 (HLA Evolved) Run-Time
  Infrastructure implemented in Go. It provides federation, declaration,
  object, ownership, data distribution, and time-management services together
  with deterministic event logging and federate SDKs for Python and C++.
authors:
  - family-names: Choi
    given-names: Changbeom
version: 0.9.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/cbchoi/gorti"
url: "https://cbchoi.github.io/gorti/"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - High Level Architecture
  - HLA Evolved
  - Run-Time Infrastructure
  - distributed simulation
  - logical time
  - reproducible simulation
